  <data name="BetCountLegend" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;div id="lengendContentContainer"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;div id="generalInfo"&gt;
&lt;div class="title-container" style="font-family: tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 96%; margin-left: 0; padding: 0px 0;"&gt;
&lt;div class="title" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #CEE1EE; height: 22px; margin-left: 6px;"&gt;
&lt;div class="title-tab" style="-moz-border-bottom-colors: none; -moz-border-left-colors: none; -moz-border-right-colors: none; -moz-border-top-colors: none; background: none repeat scroll 0 0 #CDDEF2; border-color: #E3EEF8 #E3EEF8 -moz-use-text-color; border-style: solid solid none; border-width: 1px 1px medium; color: #3361a2; display: inline; font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0; padding: 6px; text-decoration: none;"&gt;General Info&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="content" style="float: none; padding-left: 6px;"&gt;
&lt;ul style="font-size: 1.2em;"&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;For Super/Master/Agent/Member, a positive number indicates a win and vice versa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;For company, a negative number indicates a win and vice versa. Besides, a losing amount will be highlighted in &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ff0000;"&gt;red&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;All amount shown are in MYR (Malaysian ringgit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;In Deposit Group, Licensee winloss is shown under Agent column.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;Data is only available from last 3 months up to yesterday (After 11 AM, GMT -4).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;Data can be filtered by betting product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;Include won, lose, draw tickets only.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="detailsInfo"&gt;
&lt;div class="title-container" style="font-family: tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 96%; margin-left: 0; padding: 0px 0;"&gt;
&lt;div class="title" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #CEE1EE; height: 22px; margin-left: 6px;"&gt;
&lt;div class="title-tab" style="-moz-border-bottom-colors: none; -moz-border-left-colors: none; -moz-border-right-colors: none; -moz-border-top-colors: none; background: none repeat scroll 0 0 #CDDEF2; border-color: #E3EEF8 #E3EEF8 -moz-use-text-color; border-style: solid solid none; border-width: 1px 1px medium; color: #3361a2; display: inline; font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; height: 24px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0; padding: 6px; text-decoration: none;"&gt;Term definition and explanation&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="content" style="float: none; padding-left: 6px;"&gt;
&lt;ul style="font-size: 1.2em;"&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Site&lt;/strong&gt;: list of betting sites which are divided into 2 groups i.e. Credit and Deposit site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bet Count&lt;/strong&gt;: total number of betting transaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Turnover&lt;/strong&gt;: total stake amount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Member Winloss&lt;/strong&gt;: total member winloss including commission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Margin %&lt;/strong&gt;: percentage of member winloss over total turnover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMA Winloss&lt;/strong&gt;: Super-Master-Agent winloss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent&lt;/strong&gt;: total net income of Agent after deducting member commission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master&lt;/strong&gt;: total net income of Master after deducting agent commission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Super&lt;/strong&gt;: total net income of Super after deducting master commission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company&lt;/strong&gt;: total net income of company in the view of member.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</value>
